            "text": "[explore_and_descend: descended 0 floor(s) over 120 game steps; used my step budget mid-search and did not reach a down-staircase yet. Call `explore_and_descend` AGAIN to continue — it resumes the complete search for the hidden downstairs from where it stopped. But if this is the SECOND call in a row that descended 0 floors, do something else instead: pick a door or frontier from VISIBLE FEATURES and go there yourself, and eat if you are Hungry — every step here costs clock.]\n\n=== JOURNAL ===\nObjective: Descend as deep into the dungeon as you can and survive; ultimately win the game (retrieve the Amulet of Yendor and escape).\n\n=== MAP ===\n        #\n    ----.-\n    |...$.\n   #.<...|\n   #|....|\n   #------\n   ###\n     #\n     #\n     #\n     #\n     ##\n ---  #\n |$.  #     ###+\n |... #  ####\n |!..|#:##\n |F..-@\n -----\n\n\n\n\n\n\n=== STATUS ===\nHP: 14/16  AC: 6  Dlvl: 1  Turn: 104  XP: 1  $: 0  Pos: (6,16)\nCharacter: valkyrie (human, neutral)\n\n=== INVENTORY ===\n  b: a +1 long sword (weapon in hand)\n  c: a blessed +0 dagger (alternate weapon; not wielded)\n  d: an uncursed +3 small shield (being worn)\n  e: an uncursed food ration\n\n=== ADJACENT === N=# NE=: E=  SE=  S=  SW=- W=- NW=|\n\n=== HINT === No `>` visible. Nearest way out is an open doorway at (5,16) — `move_to(x=5, y=16)`. (4 exits visible.)\n\n=== VISIBLE FEATURES === stairs UP at (5,3); door (open/gap) at (8,1), (9,2), (4,3) +1 more; potion at (2,15); spellbook at (15,13); gold at (8,2), (2,13)\n\n=== VISIBLE MONSTERS === newt at (7,15), 1 step NE\n\n=== MESSAGES ===\n  The newt bites!\n"
