   ###........|         ##\n           #          ## |.......|          #\n           #          ###-......%|          #\n           ####        # |..)....-#)###     ###\n             -|------### |.......|    #-------.--\n             |..<...-#   |......:|    #|........|\n             |.....@|    ---------  # #)........|\n             |.......###############`  |........|\n             --------                  |........|\n                                       ----------\n\n\n\n\n\n\n=== STATUS ===\nHP: 16/16  AC: 6  Dlvl: 1  Turn: 2236  XP: 1  $: 21  Pos: (19,14)  Hunger: Weak\nCharacter: valkyrie (human, neutral)\n\n=== INVENTORY ===\n  $: 21 gold pieces\n  b: a +1 long sword (weapon in hand)\n  c: a +0 dagger (at the ready)\n  d: an uncursed +3 small shield (being worn)\n  g: a key\n  i: a trident\n  j: 2 red gems\n  l: 2 darts\n\n=== ADJACENT === N=. NE=- E=| SE=. S=. SW=. W=. NW=.\n\n=== HINT === Hunger is at Weak. Call `eat(item=<food letter>)` now; if no food in inventory, `pray` (once) for divine aid.\n\n=== VISIBLE FEATURES === stairs UP at (16,13); door (open/gap) at (20,2), (45,5), (11,6) +8 more; food/corpse at (32,10); weapon at (28,11), (35,11), (39,14)\n\n=== MESSAGES ===\n  Valkyrie needs food, badly!\n"
          }
