            "text": "[Pathing to (47,16): 7 steps.]\n\n=== JOURNAL ===\nObjective: Descend as deep into the dungeon as you can and survive; ultimately win the game (retrieve the Amulet of Yendor and escape).\n\nYour notes:\n  - belief_state:t25: HP 10/16 AC 6 Dlvl 1 Turn 117 max_dlvl=1 descents=0\n  - belief_state:t50: HP 12/16 AC 6 Dlvl 1 Turn 189 max_dlvl=1 descents=0\n  - dlvl_1_summary: [offline-summary] (query='key events on dlvl 1') - belief_state:t25: HP 10/16 AC 6 Dlvl 1 Turn 117 max_dlvl=1 descents=0…\n  - dlvl_2_summary: [offline-summary] (query='key events on dlvl 2') - belief_state:t25: HP 10/16 AC 6 Dlvl 1 Turn 117 max_dlvl=1 descents=0…\n  - belief_state:t75: HP 8/16 AC 6 Dlvl 3 Turn 785 max_dlvl=3 descents=2\n  - belief_state:t100: HP 16/16 AC 6 Dlvl 3 Turn 914 max_dlvl=3 descents=2\n  - belief_state:t125: HP 14/16 AC 6 Dlvl 3 Turn 1022 max_dlvl=3 descents=2\n  - dlvl_3_summary: [offline-summary] (query='key events on dlvl 3') - belief_state:t25: HP 10/16 AC 6 Dlvl 1 Turn 117 max_dlvl=1 descents=0…\n  - belief_state:t150: HP 25/28 AC 6 Dlvl 4 Turn 1227 max_dlvl=4 descents=3\n  - belief_state:t175: HP 24/28 AC 6 Dlvl 4 Turn 1471 max_dlvl=4 descents=3\n  - dlvl_4_state: Dlvl 4: No down stairs found yet. Explored most rooms. Closed door at (6,16) unexplored. Food at (11,4), (6,12), (49,17). Gold at (13,3). Yellow mold at (4,4). Need to explore behind closed door (6,16) and check remaining unexplored areas. HP 28/28, AC 6, $37.\n  - belief_state:t200: HP 36/36 AC 6 Dlvl 4 Turn 1792 max_dlvl=4 descents=3\n\n=== MAP ===\n\n\n ---------------            ------\n |.............|            |....|               -\n |.........%...|           #.....|\n |.............|           #|....|\n |..{..%........#####      #|.....##\n -----.---------    ##     #------ #\n      #              ##### ###     #\n      #                  #####     #\n      #                      #     #\n      #                      ##    #\n  ----%--                     #    #\n  |.....|     